    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1721869622\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Throughout history racing tournaments have had the goal of determining the best racer alive. However, the Chrono Club initiative has aimed to go even higher! They intend to find the best kart racer of all time, front and back! It is going to be a race against time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1721869622\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be the fastest in circuits full of danger!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/30e4c22cbec59829629b9fe739274901.poster.avif?t=1721869622\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/30e4c22cbec59829629b9fe739274901.webm?t=1721869622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/30e4c22cbec59829629b9fe739274901.mp4?t=1721869622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat your friends in local mode</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/d9ce4b537e193f2a60c26a6ab25cc9a5.poster.avif?t=1721869622\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041920/extras/d9ce4b537e193f2a60c26a6ab25cc9a5.webm?t=1721869622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse